export anchor DarkRisographStyle:
    number: 252
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark risograph
    idea: The editor is printed like a two colour zine on dark paper, fluorescent pink and teal overprinting each other with a slight misregistration, halftone dots and grain.
    base: dark
    palette:
        paper: #1c1a22, the page with a grain of cream and black dots
        card: #25222d, panels and the status stub
        deep: #141218, the canvas behind teal halftone dots, and fields
        cream: #f3ebe0, text as white ink
        dim: #c4b9ad, labels and dotted leaders
        pink: #ff5cb8, headings, the active tool, the selected layer, Share and the frame outline
        teal: #2ad0c2, the misregistered offset, Saved, secondary buttons, numbers and focus
        pinkInk: #2a0b1c, text on pink
        tealInk: #04201d, text on teal
    type:
        Avenir Next Condensed, Roboto Condensed, Arial Narrow for headings,
        tools and buttons in 800 caps, ui-rounded, Segoe UI, system-ui for
        body, and ui-monospace for small labels. Body 14px at 1.5. The file
        title 44px condensed caps in pink with a 2px teal offset shadow,
        panel titles 22px the same way, buttons 15px, labels 11 to 12px
        mono, and the sheet title 46px.
    layout:
        A masthead over a dotted teal rule holds a pink HOME V3 with a teal
        ghost and a mono line Brightwork Canvas, Website redesign, 2 colour
        print, then three overprinted initials discs, an outlined teal
        Present and a pink Share. A row of pill tools follows with icon and
        caps word, idle tools dashed cream, Move filled pink with a teal
        offset, and a teal 66% at the right. The work row puts a 250px
        Print spec card left, the canvas in the middle and a 300px layers
        card right. Print spec shows X, Y, W and H as four pink and teal ink
        blocks with big condensed values, then a dashed ruled list for
        Frame, Fill, Auto layout, Gap, Padding, Corner radius and Export.
        Layers are a numbered zine index with dotted leaders to a type word,
        Hero filled pink with selected. The canvas has teal halftone dots,
        two overlapping pink and teal circles in screen blend at the corner,
        the white frame with a pink outline and teal offset, and a teal
        bordered comment tilted slightly. A ticket stub with dashed
        perforations carries the status. Below 760px the cards and tool row
        hide and a three by two grid of pill tools sits under the canvas.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between panels, 14px inside, 10px between tools.
    density: Medium. Inspector left, canvas centre, layers right and tools as a row.
    corners: Uneven cut corners of 14 6 16 8px on cards, 12 4px on ink blocks and rows, pill tools and buttons.
    borders: Dashed cream on idle tools, a dotted teal rule under the masthead, dashed rules in the spec list and dotted leaders.
    shadows: Only misregistration, a hard 3px 2px teal offset behind pink shapes and a 2px teal text shadow on pink headings.
    icons:
        18px round line icons at 2px stroke, always beside a word. Saved
        uses a check circle in teal, editing two people in pink and the
        version a tag in cream, each with condensed caps words.
    focus: A 3px teal outline offset 3px plus a 7px pink halo at 35 percent.
    tone: Playful zine words, such as Print spec, plain elsewhere.
